{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"70386001ae330aa2b25b70b28cebd9b0b7006f36c79ff213f8d384fd10a423d5","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_4a16885620a5372997982e2f0faa7d73141de023f9eaa7d3e701eef1862b2ace","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical method for neural network morphism and does not contain a dedicated section for ethics, privacy, or broader impact. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine compliance with specific venue policies regarding anonymity, plagiarism, or mandatory impact statements, as no such policy documents or external overlap checks are available.","paper_id":"BJRIA3Fgg","paper_identity_sha256":"aeb8c9c14d6413784eafe1afac638e557377efc65a31e8594a0d581c6fc27b21","prompt_identity_sha256":"97718f3adcb3056d3fb5f49d678f8cd23549ddc9d4269fe6883d49d32ceb9a25","raw_response_sha256":"c6188a4d032f1199a7ae1e7e3f3e9c4fbbab4d46e07c25427e9b6071c43fa23c","request_identity_sha256":"214ab331fb61acb1b27aa9bccee048cf1ecff18b5b86346572b8175116caf965","reviewer_identity_sha256":"32b29c26fbf1508e066dfb25b1a9a3fe0654c5869a7da3020e1e8e61940befe3","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"d8314c239b93edd21f79e8a6af92616cb39270808df24fa4ef7b298ed0b8b379","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper focuses on the mathematical formulation and experimental validation of network morphism. There is no discussion of ethical risks, fairness, bias, or potential harms to specific populations. The supplied evidence does not support a material ethical-risk pathway, and no ethical mitigation strategies are described.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-035","SRC-040"],"review_text":"The experiments utilize standard public benchmark datasets: CIFAR10, CIFAR100, and ImageNet. The paper describes the dataset composition and training setup but does not explicitly state the licensing terms, consent protocols, or privacy compliance measures for these datasets. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine if the data usage complies with specific privacy regulations or licensing terms.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The title page lists the authors' names, institutional affiliations (University at Buffalo, Microsoft Research), and email addresses. Without a frozen venue-specific anonymity policy for the 2017 ICLR submission, it is not possible to declare a double-blind violation or confirm compliance. The visible identifying information is noted, but no policy judgment can be made based on the supplied evidence.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper cites prior work, including the authors' own previous publication (Wei et al., 2016). There is no evidence of textual overlap, figure reuse, or dual submission in the supplied text. The absence of external plagiarism checks or overlap evidence means that originality and the absence of dual submission cannot be confirmed or denied.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not include a broader impact statement, a responsible AI checklist, or any mention of IRB/ethics approvals. As no frozen policy obligation requiring these specific documents is provided in the evidence, the absence of these sections cannot be evaluated as a compliance failure. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine if the authors met any specific policy requirements for broader impact documentation.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"bd3891304c36ae29519aaf3e844efe685c61ecb0a7ea9cedf95401c4af959408","paper_id":"BJRIA3Fgg","paper_ordinal":30,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"c6188a4d032f1199a7ae1e7e3f3e9c4fbbab4d46e07c25427e9b6071c43fa23c","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"BJRIA3Fgg","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_